        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "文件把 mod 定義成多了入口檔的 plugin：入口檔叫 hooks module，Claude Code 在事件發生時呼叫裡面的函式，函式可以觀察、改寫或接手事件。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "用詞先講清楚：官方文件把 mod 的事件處理函式與設定檔的 settings hook 都叫 hook。本篇固定稱後者「設定檔 Hook」、前者「mod 的事件函式」。設定檔 Hook 在行程外運作、不能畫進介面；mod 在行程內，可畫 pane 或改寫 spinner。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "寫三個檔案"
        },
        {
          "type": "rich_paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "plugin.json 是一般的 manifest，mod 沒有額外必填欄位。hooks.json 的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "modules"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 是只放一個相對路徑的陣列，文件說有了它才算 mod。register.js 是入口。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "text",
          "label": "編輯器：確認目錄結構",
          "code": "first-mod/\n├── .claude-plugin/\n│   └── plugin.json\n├── hooks/\n│   ├── hooks.json\n│   └── register.js\n└── tests/\n    └── first-mod.test.ts\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "json",
          "label": "寫入 first-mod/.claude-plugin/plugin.json",
          "code": "{\n  \"name\": \"first-mod\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"description\": \"Counts Claude's tool calls, shows the count beside the spinner, and adds a /tally command\",\n  \"author\": { \"name\": \"Mokaair tutorial\" }\n}\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "json",
          "label": "寫入 first-mod/hooks/hooks.json",
          "code": "{\n  \"description\": \"The first-mod hooks module\",\n  \"modules\": [\"./register.js\"]\n}\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "javascript",
          "label": "寫入 first-mod/hooks/register.js",
          "code": "// The count, shared by the hooks below\nlet calls = 0\n\n// Claude Code calls this once when the mod loads\nexport function register(on) {\n  // Runs when the session starts, before your first prompt\n  on('session.start', async ($, e, next) => {\n    // Add the /tally command\n    await $.command.register({\n      name: 'tally',\n      description: 'Show how many tool calls Claude has made',\n    })\n    // Let the session start as usual\n    return next(e)\n  })\n\n  // Runs each time Claude is about to use a tool\n  on('tool.call', async ($, e, next) => {\n    calls += 1\n    // Ask Claude Code to draw the interface again, so the new count shows\n    $.ui.invalidate('ui.render')\n    // Let the tool run as usual\n    return next(e)\n  })\n\n  // Runs when you type /tally, and only then, because of the matcher\n  on('command.run', { command: 'tally' }, async () => {\n    // The text to print in the transcript\n    return { text: 'Claude has made ' + calls + ' tool calls since this mod loaded' }\n  })\n\n  // Runs each time Claude Code draws the spinner\n  on('ui.render', { component: 'Spinner' }, async ($, e, next) => {\n    // Keep Claude Code's spinner, with the count added after its word\n    return next({ ...e, props: { ...e.props, suffix: ' · tool calls: ' + calls + '…' } })\n  })\n}\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "rich_paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "session.start"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 註冊 /tally，"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "tool.call"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 計數並要求重畫，"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "command.run"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 只在 /tally 時回覆，"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "ui.render"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 把次數接在 spinner 字後。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "rich_paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "每個事件函式拿到三個引數："
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "$"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 是 mods API，能呼叫的方法都在上面；"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "e"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 是凍結的事件資料，要改就傳複本；"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "next"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 把事件交給後面的 mod 與 Claude Code 自己的行為。處理有三種：觀察（回傳 "
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "next(e)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "）、接手（如 "
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "command.run"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "，不呼叫 "
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "next"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "，第二個引數 "
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "{ command: 'tally' }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 是 matcher）、改寫（如 "
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "ui.render"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "，把複本交給 "
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "next"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "）。"
            }
          ]
